Input parameters for horizon finder
Find horizons after timesteps or times (don't search for Horizons: findtimes < 0)
      findsteps = 0
      findtimes = 0.1
Parameter eta in expansion equation
      eta = -1.0
Parameters for elliptic solver
      tol_ell = 1.e-9
      max_iter_ell = 10000
Parameters for expansion loop
      tol_exp = 1.e-4
      max_iter_exp = 100
Initial mass guess
      mass_guess = 1.0

NOTE: to use times as criterion, set findsteps = 0.  If findsteps > 0 will
use number of steps as criterion for searching for horizons.
